# EXPECT: must belong to the property's domain
# A customer carrying a campaign budget, a property whose domain is a marketing campaign.
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
o4de:BadCustomer a owl:NamedIndividual, o4de:Customer ; rdfs:label "Bad customer" ; o4de:campaignBudget "10.0"^^xsd:decimal .
